              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, kwenu nyinyi maono yote haya ni kama ujumbe ulioandikwa katika kitabu kilichofungwa kwa mhuri. Ukimpelekea mtu yeyote ajuaye kusoma, ukamwambia, “Hebu nisomee kitabu hiki,” atasema, “Siwezi kukisoma kwani kimefungwa kwa mhuri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ukimpa mtu yeyote asiyejua kusoma, ukamwambia, “Hebu nisomee kitabu hiki,” atakuambia, “Sijui kusoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
